      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5099\u3048\u3063\u3066\u3001\u305D\u3063\u3061\u304B\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, that kind of prevention..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3002\u6C17\u3092\u4ED8\u3051\u308B\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But thanks. I\u0027ll be careful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5148\u4EBA\u306E\u77E5\u6075",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wisdom of the ancients"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u935B\u3048\u308B\u306B\u306F\u3001\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u30B3\u30C4\u304C\u3042\u308B\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3002\n\u5148\u4EBA\u306E\u77E5\u6075\u306B\u983C\u3063\u3066\u307F\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There seem to be proper techniques for training.\nI looked into what our predecessors discovered."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8ABF\u3079\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3092\u7D19\u306B\u307E\u3068\u3081\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u8AAD\u3093\u3067\u307B\u3057\u3044\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ve compiled everything I researched,\nand I\u0027d like you to read it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3088\u3044\u3057\u3087\u3063\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Here you go!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u308F\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u5206\u539A\u3044\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa! That\u0027s thick..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8AAD\u3093\u3067\u308B\u305D\u3070\u304B\u3089\n\u5FD8\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3044\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll probably forget everything\nas soon as I read it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u71B1\u610F\u306F\u4F1D\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I can feel how much effort you put into this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52B9\u7387\u7684\u306A\u8EAB\u4F53\u4F5C\u308A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Efficient body building"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u7B4B\u529B\u3092\u4E0A\u3052\u308B\u30B3\u30EB\u30BB\u30C3\u30C8\u3068\u304B\n\u304A\u3082\u308A\u306E\u5165\u3063\u305F\u9774\u3068\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could it be a strength-boosting corset\nor weighted shoes!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9006\u306B\u3001\u7FFC\u306E\u3064\u3044\u305F\u670D\u3084\u3001\n\u885D\u6483\u3092\u5438\u53CE\u3059\u308B\u624B\u888B\u306E\u53EF\u80FD\u6027\u3082\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Or maybe clothes with wings,\nor shock-absorbing gloves!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3046\u3093\u3002\u305D\u3046\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u3068\u3063\u3066\u304A\u304D\u306E\u79D8\u7B56\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, it\u0027s not that, but I do have\na special strategy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5207\u308A\u672D\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A trump card!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3063\u3068\u3082\u3063\u3068\u3001\u624B\u8EFD\u306A\u65B9\u6CD5\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s actually a much simpler method."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u672C\u5F53\u306F\u3001\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u3092\u5FDC\u7528\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...To be honest, I wanted to use\nalchemy somehow."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u7B4B\u529B\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u51FA\u3059\u85AC\u306B\u306F\n\u53CD\u52D5\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3057\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But medicines that boost strength\nhave side effects..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3061\u306E\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3092\n\u8D85\u3048\u308B\u3082\u306E\u306F\u4F5C\u308C\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I can\u0027t make anything better\nthan your family\u0027s hammer."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u8EAB\u4F53\u306E\u4ED5\u7D44\u307F\u3092\u52C9\u5F37\u3057\u305F\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I studied how the body works instead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u935B\u932C\u306E\u52B9\u679C\u3092\u3001\u3082\u3063\u3068\u5F15\u304D\u51FA\u3059\u305F\u3081\u306B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To help you get more out of your training!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3054\u3001\u3054\u304F\u308A\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "G-gulp...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u3002\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u305D\u308C\u304C\u3001\n\u300C\u4F11\u3080\u300D\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait. Don\u0027t tell me...\nYou mean \u0027rest\u0027?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3046\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yeah."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u306E\u3084\u308A\u65B9\u3058\u3083\u3001\u3044\u304F\u3089\u935B\u932C\u3057\u3066\u3082\n\u8EAB\u306B\u3064\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3068\u601D\u3046\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don\u0027t think your current method will help you\nimprove, no matter how much you train."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3063\u304B\u30FC\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3001\u7D0D\u5F97\u3057\u3066\u306A\u3044\u3088\u306D\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(As I thought, she\u0027s not convinced.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u3089\u4F1D\u308F\u308B\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3002\n\u3000\u8EAB\u8FD1\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3092\u4F8B\u306B\u51FA\u305B\u3070\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(How can I get through to her?\nMaybe I should use a familiar example.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305F\u3068\u3048\u3070\u3001\u6B66\u5668\u306B\u624B\u5165\u308C\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u306E\u3068\n\u3000\u540C\u3058\u3088\u3046\u306B\u2026\u2026\u3068\u304B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Like how weapons need maintenance\njust like people do...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3042\u306E\u306D\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\n\u5FC3\u914D\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u306E\u306F\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3051\u3069",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You know, I\u0027m happy that you\u0027re worried about me,\nbut..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305A\u3063\u3068\u8FFD\u3044\u8FBC\u3093\u3067\u304D\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306F\u3053\u3053\u307E\u3067\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u308C\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I got this strong because\nI\u0027ve always pushed myself to the limit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3068\u540C\u3058\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s just like your hammer"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\uFF1F\u3000\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? I am?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3088\u308A\u3001\u4EBA\u3082\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3082\u2026\u2026\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, both people and hammers... actually."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7B4B\u8089\u306F\u3001\u935B\u3048\u308B\u307B\u3069\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3046\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think muscles get stronger\nthe more you train them, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u672C\u5F53\u306F\u3001\u4F11\u3093\u3067\u308B\u3068\u304D\u306B\u3053\u305D\n\u767A\u9054\u3057\u3066\u308B\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But actually, they develop most\nwhen you\u0027re resting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3001\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3082\u540C\u3058\u3067\u3001\n\u4F7F\u3046\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\u30DC\u30ED\u30DC\u30ED\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s the same with hammers\u2014\njust using them will wear them out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u306A\u306E\u304B\u306F\u3001\n\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u307B\u3046\u304C\u8A73\u3057\u3044\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You probably know more about this\nthan I do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u591A\u5206\u3001\u624B\u5165\u308C\u3057\u3066\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089\u304B\u306A\u3002\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306F\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe because they\u0027re not maintained properly.\nI always make sure to..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right, Izana!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3093\u306A\u306B\u6700\u5F37\u306E\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u306B\u3082\n\u624B\u5165\u308C\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3082\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even your amazing hammer\nneeds maintenance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306B\u3082\u3001\u304A\u4F11\u307F\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You need rest too, Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3063\u304B\u2026\u2026\u3046\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... Okay! I understand!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52AA\u529B\u5BB6\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s because you work hard"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8FFD\u3044\u8FBC\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3001\n\u6BCE\u65E5\u30B3\u30C4\u30B3\u30C4\u7D9A\u3051\u305F\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You didn\u0027t get stronger just by pushing yourself\u2014\nit\u0027s because you kept at it every day."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D99\u7D9A\u529B\u3053\u305D\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u529B\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your perseverance is your true strength, Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3046\u3093\u3001\u305C\u3093\u305C\u3093\u8DB3\u308A\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, it\u0027s not nearly enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u3054\u3044\u4EBA\u305F\u3061\u306B\u8FFD\u3044\u3064\u304F\u304F\u3089\u3044\u3001\n\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u3089\u306A\u304F\u3061\u3083",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I need to get strong enough\nto catch up to those amazing people."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3067\u306D\u3001\u3069\u3093\u306A\u8105\u5A01\u304B\u3089\u3082\n\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3092\u5B88\u3063\u3066\u307F\u305B\u308B\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I\u0027ll be able to protect you\nfrom any threat!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E00\u9014\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s because you\u0027re single-minded"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5922\u306B\u4E00\u9014\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u6642\u9593\u3092\n\u6CE8\u304E\u8FBC\u3093\u3067\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You got stronger because you\u0027re so dedicated\nto your dream that you put all your time into it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u60F3\u3044\u306E\u5F37\u3055\u304C\u3001\n\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u6B66\u5668\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think that strong determination\nis your greatest weapon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u60F3\u3044\u306A\u3089\u3001\u8AB0\u306B\u3082\u8CA0\u3051\u306A\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When it comes to determination, I won\u0027t lose to anyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3064\u3082\u308A\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\n\u304B\u306A\u308F\u306A\u3044\u4EBA\u305F\u3061\u304C\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Or so I thought, but there are people\nI can\u0027t match with just that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3001\u307E\u3060\u307E\u3060\u306A\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I still have so far to go."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u3054\u3044\u306A\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re amazing, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8EAB\u4F53\u4F5C\u308A\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3001\n\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u306E\u3053\u3068\u307E\u3067\u52C9\u5F37\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You studied not just about physical training,\nbut about hammers too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You believe me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u304B\u3092\u77E5\u308A\u305F\u304F\u306A\u3063\u305F\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306F\u3001\n\u5FB9\u5E95\u7684\u306B\u8ABF\u3079\u308B\u3063\u3066\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u308B\u304B\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know that when you want to learn something,\nyou research it thoroughly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u610F\u5730\u3092\u5F35\u308B\u306E\u3092\u3084\u3081\u3066\u3001\n\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u304A\u4F11\u307F\u3059\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll stop being stubborn today\nand take a break with you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\uFF01\n\u3000\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u53D7\u3051\u5165\u308C\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Thank goodness!\nIzana finally accepted.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 99,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u6E96\u5099\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308B\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, I\u0027ll go prepare a bit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F11\u307F\u3092\u601D\u3044\u3063\u304D\u308A\u6E80\u55AB\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So we can make the most of our break!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana..."
        }
